21
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:35,140
The book assumes that

22
00:00:35,140 --> 00:00:37,860
people tend to focus their attention on themselves

23
00:00:37,860 --> 00:00:39,000
rather than on others.

24
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:40,920
This leads to a conclusion:

25
00:00:40,920 --> 00:00:43,040
when people like something,

26
00:00:43,040 --> 00:00:45,680
they often like more than just the thing itself,

27
00:00:45,680 --> 00:00:48,540
